transactions

Required:
transaction_type
COUNT
SUM

Grouping:
transaction_type

Filter groups:
SUM > 1 crore

Sort if required

Query:

SELECT
    transaction_type,
    COUNT(*) AS transaction_count,
    SUM(amount) AS total_amount
FROM transactions
GROUP BY transaction_type
HAVING SUM(amount) > 10000000
ORDER BY total_amount DESC;

